    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary exponentiation</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Math</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/powx-n/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 50</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Pow(x, n)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Read n in binary: square the base once per bit and multiply it into the answer only where the bit is 1. Turn a negative n into 1/x first, but widen n to 64 bits before negating, because -(-2³¹) does not fit in an int. O(log |n|) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
